<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .title-block {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .title-block h1 {
    font-size: 28pt;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .title-block h2 {
    font-size: 16pt;
    margin: 5px 0 0 0;
  }
  .intro-text {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .bullet-list {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .bullet-list li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .question-block {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }
  .question-text {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .radio-options label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .radio-options input[type="radio"] {
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .grid-options {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 20px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .grid-options div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .grid-options .radio-group {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .grid-options .radio-group label {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .text-area-container {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .text-area-container textarea {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100px;
    padding: 10px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .icon-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .icon-section .icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin-right: 15px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .icon-section .description {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"></div>
    <div>
      <h1>{{ organization_name }}</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="title-block">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 40pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">M I D D I</div>
      <h2>{{ assessment_title }}</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-text">
    <p>We are asking you to take a survey to help the {{ organization_name }} plan their work in the <strong>next five years</strong>. This plan will be used to apply for federal funding to maintain {{ organization_name }} as {{ organization_description }}.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bullet-list">
    <ul>
      <li>The mission of {{ organization_name }} is to contribute to inclusive communities and quality of life for people with developmental disabilities and their families through education, community support and services, research, and communication.</li>
      <li>We want to learn about the needs of you and others in Michigan. This will help {{ organization_name }} better serve people with intellectual and developmental disabilities (I/DD) and their families.</li>
      <li>You are invited to participate in the survey if you live or work in Michigan and are 18 years or older.</li>
      <li>The survey will take about 10-20 minutes to complete. Please only take the survey once. Your responses do not include your name and are private.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="bullet-list">
    <ul>
      <li>If you need assistance completing the survey or would like to do the survey over the phone, please call {{ phone_number }}.</li>
      <li>At the end of the survey, you will have the option to be entered into a drawing to <strong>receive one of ten $50 Target gift cards</strong>. You will be automatically redirected to this form. To keep your survey responses private, the surveys will be kept separate from your contact info for the drawing.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>Thank you for your time!</p>

  <div class="section-title">What is your connection to the disability community? (Check all that apply)</div>
  <div class="radio-options">
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="connection_checkboxes[{{ loop.index0 }}]" value="{{ connection_checkboxes[loop.index0] }}"> Person with I/DD</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="connection_checkboxes[{{ loop.index0 }}]" value="{{ connection_checkboxes[loop.index0] }}"> Family member of a person with I/DD</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="connection_checkboxes[{{ loop.index0 }}]" value="{{ connection_checkboxes[loop.index0] }}"> Provider of services to people with I/DD and/or their family members</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="connection_checkboxes[{{ loop.index0 }}]" value="{{ connection_checkboxes[loop.index0] }}"> Policymaker or advocate for people with I/DD</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">The first part of survey will ask questions about your needs in these areas:</div>
  <div class="bullet-list">
    <ul>
      <li>Direct Support Workers</li>
      <li>Getting Older</li>
      <li>Criminal Justice</li>
      <li>Education</li>
      <li>Transitioning to Adulthood</li>
      <li>Employment</li>
      <li>Health and Wellness</li>
      <li>Accessing Healthcare</li>
      <li>Mental Health</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="bullet-list">
    <ul>
      <li>Social Inclusion</li>
      <li>Housing</li>
      <li>Self-determination</li>
      <li>Legal Authority and Rights</li>
      <li>Transportation</li>
      <li>Family Support</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="icon-section">
    <div class="icon"></div>
    <div class="description">
      <strong>DIRECT SUPPORT WORKERS</strong> – Direct Support Workers include professionals who support and work with individuals with I/DD.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <div class="question-text">1a. How much need do people with I/DD have for <strong>direct support workers</strong>?</div>
    <div class="grid-options">
      <div>
        <p>A lot of need</p>
        <div class="radio-group"><input type="radio" name="direct_support_need_a" data-field="direct_support_need_a_value" value="{{ direct_support_need_a_value }}"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Some need</p>
        <div class="radio-group"><input type="radio" name="direct_support_need_b" data-field="direct_support_need_b_value" value="{{ direct_support_need_b_value }}"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Little or No need</p>
        <div class="radio-group"><input type="radio" name="direct_support_need_c" data-field="direct_support_need_c_value" value="{{ direct_support_need_c_value }}"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <div class="question-text">1b. When thinking about <strong>direct support workers</strong>, what is most important? (Please select only one response)</div>
    <div class="radio-options">
      <label><input type="radio" name="direct_support_importance_a" data-field="direct_support_importance_a_value" value="{{ direct_support_importance_a_value }}"> Good pay and benefits for direct support workers</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="direct_support_importance_b" data-field="direct_support_importance_b_value" value="{{ direct_support_importance_b_value }}"> Finding good direct support workers</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="direct_support_importance_c" data-field="direct_support_importance_c_value" value="{{ direct_support_importance_c_value }}"> Training for direct support workers on topics such as person centered planning</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="direct_support_importance_d" data-field="direct_support_importance_d_value" value="{{ direct_support_importance_d_value }}"> Other, please specify: <input type="text" data-field="direct_support_other_specify" value="{{ direct_support_other_specify }}"></label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <div class="question-text">1c. Use the space below to share any comments about <strong>direct support workers</strong>.</div>
    <div class="text-area-container">
      <textarea data-field="direct_support_comments">{{ direct_support_comments }}</textarea>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="icon-section">
