  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="icon-section">
    <div class="icon"></div>
    <div class="description">
      <strong>EDUCATION</strong> – Education includes the education of individuals with I/DD from birth to kindergarten through twelfth grade (or until age 26).
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <div class="question-text">4a. How much need do people with I/DD have in <strong>education</strong>?</div>
    <div class="grid-options">
